  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to finance Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;Access to Finance&apos; project enables Orange Corners Dhaka beneficiaries to get access to seed capital of up to 50,000 euros to grow their company. The programme aims to stimulate innovation, and the innovative aspect of the business will be an important criterion for selecting participants in the programme. It will be a condition that each business idea will have a positive social or ecological impact and address at least one SDG. Furthermore, each beneficiary will have to commit themself fully to the programme for the duration of the acceleration programme. It is a great benefit if a business idea fits within the circular economy.</narrative>
  </description>
